@host = http://localhost:5000
@tripId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Call manually after viewing quote, and again after a driver rejects
POST {{host}}/api/v1/matching/match
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tripId": "{{tripId}}" }

### Invitation history and configurable limit
GET {{host}}/api/v1/matching/sessions

### Current driver positions and availability
GET {{host}}/api/v1/matching/drivers/locations
